<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1YO - Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 YOHANE</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Yo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Yohane</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANE</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ OLI MOA</para>
  <para style="ip">Suaniɛ bɔ ne Yesu kuro ye dwirɛ ne, ye yeɛ ɔhworɔle 1 Yohane, 2 Yohane, 3 Yohane, ɔne Adiisɛm nwomaa ne. Ngrataa nza bɔ Yohane hworɔle ne, 1 Yohane ne yeɛ ɔwale paa ɔ. Kɔyɛ afoɛ 98 Y.A <note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeɛ Yohane hworɔle krataa he ɔ, na ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Efeso anaa ɛberɛ nekaa bie. Sɛ ɛnea nwomaa he a, wanga mmenia bɔ ɔhworɔ mane bɛ ne, yeti ɛkora nwu ye kyɛ, Yohane hworɔle ye krataa ne mane Kristofoɛ mukoraati. Yohane ngrataa nemɔ de, edwirɛ bɔ odi akoten wɔ nu paa yeɛ ole <char style="bdit">ɔdɔ</char>. Na né ɔtaa frɛ ye atiefoɛ nemɔ “<char style="it">adɔfo</char>” anaa “<char style="it">me mmaa mmaa-mmaa</char>.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Né 1 Yohane ne atirimbɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔkɔboka ye atiefoɛ nemɔ maa bɛ gyidie kɔyɛ se wɔ nahorɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aye ahyire Kristofoɛ nanu. Nningyein nza yeɛ krataa he ka ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• <char style="iqt">Antikristo</char>;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• <char style="iqt">Bɔne</char>;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• <char style="iqt">Ɔdɔ</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane krataa ne ahyɛaseɛ ne, ɔhane kyɛ “Nyameɛ te kanea,” ná odikyɛ Kristofoɛ nate sɔ kanea nanu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 1:5">1Yo 1:5</ref></char>) Sɛ yɛkɔhora yɛkɔyɛ sɔ a, odikyɛ yedɛ yɛtonu kyɛ yɛte abɔnefoɛ, yeti yɛhia bɔne-fakyɛ bɔ ɔnate Yesu Kristo afɔleɛ naso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Osa fale Nyameɛ mmaa totole Abɔnzam mmaa nwo. Bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu nzonzonyɛ ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ mmaa dodɔ bɛ nwo, na Abɔnzam mmaa de, bayɛ kyɛ Kain, ebiala tane ye mmango. Ɔtoa so ne, ɔhane bɔ ɔdɔ kyire deinn. Ohyirele nu kyɛ, ɛngɔhora ngɔlɔ Nyameɛ bɔ ɛnnwu ye ne, ná eliema bɔ enwu ye ne de, ɛnnɔ ye. Yeti bɔ okyire kyɛ yɛdɔ Nyameɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛkoli ye ahyɛdeɛ anaa ye mmeraa so.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanea ne awosii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 1:2-2:29">1:2–2:29</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyameɛ mmaa ne Abɔnzam mmaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nahorɛ ne bɔne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 4:1-6">4:1-6</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔdɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 4:7-21">4:7-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gyidie di ngunim (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1JN 5:1-21">5:1-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Ngoa dwirɛ bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ fi ahyɛaseɛ ne, yate ye nwo dwirɛ, yafa yɛ nye yanwu ye, yanea, na yafa yɛ sa yaha ye, <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />(bɛlale sɔ ngoa ne ali ne, yɛnwuni ye, na yɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ, daa ngoa bɔ né ɔwɔ Baba ne nwo berɛ bɔ ɔlale ye ali ne, ɛhene yeɛ yɛka ye nwo dwirɛ yɛkyire ɛmɔ ne.) <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Bɔ yanwu ye na yate ne, ɛhene yeɛ yɛka ye nwo dwirɛ yɛkyire ɛmɔ, ná wamaa ɛmɔ ne yɛ afa adamvoa, kyɛbɔ yɛne Baba ne né ɔwa Yesu Kristo afa adamvoa ne. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Yɛtworɔ ɛhe yɛbrɛ ɛmɔ, na wamaa y'anigye ali mu.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Edwirɛ bɔ yɛte yɛfili ye berɛ, bɔ yɛpena kyɛ yɛka yɛkyire ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ te kanea, na awosii biala nne ye nu. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Sɛ yɛka kyɛ “Yɛne ye afa adamvoa” na yɛkɔ so yɛnate awosii nu a, né yɛpɛ anoanu, na yɛmva nahorɛ ne yɛmmɔ yɛ bra. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Nakoso, sɛ yɛkɔ so yɛnate kanea nanu, kyɛbɔ ɔwɔ kanea nu ne a, ye de yɛne yɛ nwo afa adamvoa, na ɔwa Yesu mogya ne nwunzi yɛ nwo fi bɔne mukoraati nwo. <verse eid="1JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Sɛ yɛka kyɛ, “Bɔne nne yɛ nwo” a, né yɛlaka-laka yɛ nwo, na nahorɛ ne nne yɛ nu. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ odi nahorɛ na ɔtengyɛ nati, sɛ yɛka yɛ bɔne a, ɔkɔfa kɔhyɛ yɛ, na wanwunzi yɛ nwo wafi yɛ bɔne mukoraati nwo. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Sɛ yɛka kyɛ, “Yɛyɛlle bɔne a,” né yɛma ɔyɛ ngondomboniɛ, na ye dwirɛ ne nne yɛ nu.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Me mmaa mɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ “ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa”</char></note> metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ, na ɛmɔ anyɛ bɔne. Nakoso, sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie yɛ bɔne a, yele kamafoɛ<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “ebie bɔ ɔboka yɛ”</char></note> wɔ Baba ne nwo berɛ, yeɛ ole teneneeniɛ Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Ye yeɛ ɔpata<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “ɔte mbata afɔleɛ”</char></note> ma yɛ bɔne, nná yɛ ngome, mmom ewiase namukoraati. <verse eid="1JN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Sɛ yɛkɔ so yɛdi ye ahyɛdeɛ so a, ɛhene yeɛ okyire kyɛ yɛse ye ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Sɛ ebie ka kyɛ: “Mese Ye,” nakoso onni ye ahyɛdeɛ so a, né ɔlaka, na nahorɛ ne nne ye nu. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Nakoso, ebiala bɔ odi ye dwirɛ so ne, sɔ sona nanu yeɛ Nyameɛ dɔ di mu ɔ. Na ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ yɛne ye te kõ. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔka kyɛ ɔne ye te kõ ne, odikyɛ ɔkɔ so bɔ ye bra kyɛbɔ Yesu bɔle ye bra ne.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Aliemaa mɔ, nná ahyɛdeɛ foforɛ bie yeɛ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ɔ, mmon ahyɛdeɛ bɔ ahyɛaseɛ ne ɛmɔ nyane ye nala. Sɔ ahyɛdeɛ daa ne yeɛ ole edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔtele ne. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Afei, metworɔ ahyɛdeɛ foforɛ mebrɛ ɛmɔ. Sɔ ahyɛdeɛ ne, ɔte nahorɛ wɔ ye ne ɛmɔ nu. Ofikyɛ awosii ne pɛ nu, ná kanea né ahyɛ yebo ɔta. <verse eid="1JN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Ebiala bɔ ɔka kyɛ ɔwɔ kanea nanu, nakoso ɔtane oliema ne, ɔtɛ́ wɔ awosii nu. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Ebiala bɔ ɔdɔ oliema ne wɔ kanea nu, na sintidua biala nne ye nu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nikye biala nne yenu bɔ ɔkɔto ebie sintidua.”</char></note> <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔtane oliema ne wɔ awosii nu, sɔ sona ne nate awosii nu, na ɔnze nekaa bɔ ɔkɔ ɔ, ofikyɛ awosii ne asi ye nye.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Me mmaa mɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ “ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa”</char></note> metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:12">ofikyɛ ye dumaa nati, bafa ɛmɔ bɔne bahyɛ ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Baba mɔ, metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ anwu bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ fi ahyɛaseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Mmrandeɛ, metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ali ɔbɔnefoɛ naso ngunim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Ngwalaa, metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:13">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ anwu Baba ne.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Baba mɔ, metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ anwu bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ fi ahyɛaseɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Mmrandeɛ, metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">ofikyɛ ɛmɔ nwo yɛ se, Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne tɛ́ wɔ ɛmɔ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">na ɛmɔ ali ɔbɔnefoɛ naso ngunim.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Nnɛmɔ nya ɔdɔ bɛma ewiase ne, anaa nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ wiase nanu ne. Sɛ ebie dɔ wiase ne a, ɔnnɔ Baba ne. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ ewiase ne—anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ, anyeɛ akɔnnɔ, ɔne nningyein bɔ sona fa hoahoa ye nwo ne—nná Baba ne berɛ yeɛ ofi ɔ, mmom ofi wiase. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Afei ewiase ne, ɔne ye akɔnnɔ ne pɛ nu, nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ne kɔtena berɛ daa.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Me mmaa mɔ, mmerɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne ɛhe, na kyɛbɔ ɛmɔtele kyɛ <char style="tl">antikristo</char> kɔwa ne, kesaalae de, <char style="tl">antikristo</char> pee awa wiase. Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ yɛwɔ mmerɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo nanu ne. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Bɛfili yɛ nu yeɛ bɛhɔle ɔ, nakoso, né bɛ bokka yɛ so, ofikyɛ sɛ bɛboka yɛ so a, ahaa bɛne yɛ tenane. Nakoso, bɛfili yɛ nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yekonwu kyɛ nná ebiala yeɛ ɔboka yɛ so ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Na ɛmɔ de, krongroniɛ ne asra ɛmɔ, na ɛmɔ nu biala le nimdeɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Krataa he bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ne, ongyire kyɛ ɛmɔnze nahorɛ ne, mmom bɔ ɔmaa metworɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔse nahorɛ ne, na ɛmɔse kyɛ ngondombo biala mvi nahorɛ nanu mma. <verse eid="1JN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Nwa yeɛ ole ngondomboniɛ ne? Yeɛ ole sona bɔ onne ndonu kyɛ Yesu te Kristo ne. Sona bɔ onne Baba ne ne Baa ne ndonu ne, ye yeɛ ole <char style="tl">antikristo </char> ne. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Ebiala bɔ onne Baa ne ndonu ne, onne Baba ne koso ndonu, nakoso, ebiala bɔ odɛ́ Baba ne to nu ne, odɛ́ Baa ne koso to nu. <verse eid="1JN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Yeti, ɛmɔma edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔ ate bafi ahyɛaseɛ ne tena ɛmɔ nu, na bɔ ɛmɔ ate bafi ahyɛaseɛ ne tena ɛmɔ nu a, ɛmɔ kɔtena Baa ne, ɔne Baba ne nu daa. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Na bɔ wafa wahyɛ yɛ bɔ yeɛ ole daa ngoa.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ne, ɔfa bɛ bɔ bɛpena kyɛ bɛlaka-laka ɛmɔ nanwo. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Na ɛmɔ de, bɔ ɔfa srale ɛmɔ ne tɛ́ wɔ ɛmɔ nu, yeti ye nwo nhia kyɛ ebiala kyirekyire ɛmɔ. Ofikyɛ nikye bɔ ɔfa srale ɛmɔ ne kyirekyire ɛmɔ nikye biala, ɔka nahorɛ, ɔmbɛ anoanu. Kyɛbɔ wahyirehyire ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔ ne bɔ ɔsrale ɛmɔ ne yɛ kõ.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Yeti, me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔ ne ye yɛ kõ, na sɛ bɛda ye ali a, yahora yadwudwo, na yamvɛle wɔ ye nyunu. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Sɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ a, ye de ɛmɔse kyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne, ye yeɛ ɔwole ye ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Nnaa ɛmɔ anwu ɔdɔ kandinga bɔ Baba nala ye ali ahyire yɛ ne, yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛfrɛ yɛ Nyameɛ mmaa. Na yɛte ye mmaa koso. Ɛhene ati yeɛ wiase ne nze yɛ ne, ofikyɛ benya bɛnwuni ye. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Aliemaa mɔ, kesaalae, yɛte Nyameɛ mmaa, nakoso, bɔ yɛkɔyɛ ye kyẽa bie ne de, yɛnnya yɛnwuni ye. Yɛse kyɛ sɛ Kristo ye ye nwo ali a, yɛkɔyɛ kyɛ ye, ofikyɛ yekonwu ye, kyɛbɔ ɔte nala. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Ebiala bɔ ole sɔ anidasoɛ he wɔ yenu ne, ye nwo ate, kyɛbɔ Kristo nwo ate nala.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne ne, wato mmeraa, ofikyɛ ɛto mmeraa a, ayɛ bɔne. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Nakoso, ɛmɔse kyɛ Kristo wale kyɛ ɔbaaye yɛ bɔne fi berɛ, na ye de, bɔne nne ye nwo. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Ebiala bɔ ɔne Ye ayɛ kõ ne, ɔtte bɔne nu;<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔngɔ so nnyɛ bɔne.”</char></note> ebiala bɔ ɔte bɔne nu ne de, onwunni Nyameɛ, anaa ɔnze ye. <verse eid="1JN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Me mmaa mɔ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa.”</char></note> nnɛmɔ maa ebiala laka-laka ɛmɔ, ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne, ɔte teneneeniɛ, kyɛbɔ Ye koso ɔte teneneeniɛ nala. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Ebiala bɔ ɔte bɔne nu ne, ofi Abɔnzam, ofikyɛ Abɔnzam yeɛ wayɛ bɔne fi tete.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ “Mmerɛ bɔ ɔhyɛle yebo yɛle bɔne ne;” “mmerɛ bɔ ɔtele Nyameɛ so atua ne.”</char></note> Ɛhene ati yeɛ bɛlale Nyameɛ awa ne ali, kyɛ ɔɔsɛkye Abɔnzam nyumaa. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Ebiala bɔ Nyameɛ awo ye ne, ɔtte bɔne nu, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ suban<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">NT: “Nyameɛ aba”</char></note> te ye nu, na ɔngɔhora ngɔtena bɔne nu, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ wawo ye ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu Nyameɛ mmaa ne Abɔnzam mmaa ɔ: Ebiala bɔ ɔnyɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne, offi Nyameɛ berɛ, na bɔ ɔnnɔ oliema ne koso, offi Nyameɛ berɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Edwirɛ bɔ ofi ahyɛaseɛ ne, ɛmɔtele yeɛ ole kyɛ: Ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Nnɛmɔyɛ kyɛ Kain bɔ ofi Abɔnzam, bɔ ohuni oliema ne. Nzuati yeɛ ohuni ye ne? Ofikyɛ, ye bɔbɔ ye nneyɛɛ te bɔne, na oliema ne de, ye deɛ te pa. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, sɛ wiase ne tane ɛmɔ a, nnɛmɔ maa ɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Yɛse kyɛ yafi ewue nu yawa ngoa nu, ofikyɛ yɛdɔ yɛliema mɔ. Ebiala bɔ ɔnnɔ oliema ne, ɔtɛ́ te ewue nu. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Ebiala bɔ ɔtane oliema ne te wudiniɛ, na ɛmɔse kyɛ wudiniɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ daa ngoa te ye nu ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu bɔ ɔdɔ kyire ɔ: Yesu fale ye ngoa tole berɛ mane yɛ, yeti odikyɛ yɛ koso yɛfa yɛ ngoa yɛto berɛ yɛma yɛliema mɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Sɛ ebie bɔ ole wiase ahonyadeɛ nwu kyɛ oliema nwo kyere ye, ná onnwu ye anwunvo a, nzu yeɛ okyire kyɛ Nyameɛ dɔ te ye nu ɔ? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Me mmaa mɔ, nnɛmɔ maa yɛfa yɛ noa, anaa yɛ temverema ngome yɛka kyɛ yɛdɔ yɛliema mɔ, mmom ɛmɔma yɛfa yɛ nneyɛɛ, na yɛyɛ ye wɔ nahorɛ nu.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu ye kyɛ yɛwɔ nahorɛ nanu ne, na ɔmaa y'ahone tɔ yɛ kunu wɔ ye nyunu: <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Sɛ y'ahone bu yɛ fɔ po a, Nyameɛ te piri tra y'ahone, na ɔse nikye biala. <verse eid="1JN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Nniema mɔ, sɛ y'ahone mmu yɛ fɔ a, yɛkora yɛfa ahotɔsoɛ yɛkɔ Nyameɛ nyunu; <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />na nikye biala bɔ yɛkobisa ye ne, yɛ sa kɔha ye, ofikyɛ yɛdi Ye mmraa so, na yɛyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ ye nye. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Ná y'ahyɛdeɛ ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛnya gyidie wɔ ɔwa Yesu Kristo dumaa nanu, na yɛdodɔ yɛ nwo, kyɛbɔ wafa ahyɛdeɛ wama yɛ ne. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Ebiala bɔ odi sɔ ahyɛdeɛ naso ne, ɔne ye ayɛ kõ, na ye koso, ɔne sɔ sona ne ayɛ kõ. Na honhom bɔ ɔfa mane yɛ ne yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ yɛne ye ayɛ kõ.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, nná honhom nu dwirɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Honhom.”</char></note> biala yeɛ odikyɛ ɛmɔdɛ ye bɛdi ɔ. Mmom ɛmɔsɔ honhom nu dwirɛ<note caller="°" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Honhom.”</char></note> biala bɛnea sɛ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ a, ofikyɛ ngondombo adiifoɛ pee awa wiase. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Ɛhe yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konwu honhom bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne: Honhom biala bɔ ɔka kyɛ Yesu Kristo wale anwoɔnaen nu ne, ofi Nyameɛ berɛ, <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />nakoso honhom biala bɔ ɔka kyɛ Yesu amma anwoɔnaen nu ne, offi Nyameɛ. Ɛhe yeɛ ole honhom nu dwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔtele kyɛ okofi <char style="tl">antikristo</char> ne berɛ kɔwa ne, na kesaalae, wawa wiase. <verse eid="1JN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔfi Nyameɛ berɛ, na ɛmɔ ali bɛ so ngunim, ofikyɛ bɔ ɔte ɛmɔ nu ne, ɔte piri tra bɔ ɔwɔ wiase ne. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Bɛfi wiase, yeti yeɛ bɛka edwirɛ bɔ ofi wiase, ná ewiase ne koso tie bɛ ne. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Yɛ de, yefi Nyameɛ berɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔse Nyameɛ ne tie yɛ, na ebiala bɔ offi Nyameɛ berɛ ne de, ondie yɛ. Ɛhe yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu honhom nu dwirɛ bɔ ɔte nahorɛ, ɔne honhom nu dwirɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ ne.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔma yɛdodɔ yɛ nwo, ofikyɛ ɔdɔ fi Nyameɛ berɛ. Ebiala bɔ ole ɔdɔ ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ wawo ye ɔ, na ɔse Nyameɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Ebiala bɔ olle ɔdɔ ne, ɔnze Nyameɛ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ ole ɔdɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Atee bɔ Nyameɛ fale so lale ye dɔ ne ali hyirele yɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔsomane ɔwa komapɛ ne wale wiase, kyɛ yɛfa ye so yɛnya ngoa. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Ɛhe yeɛ ole ɔdɔ ne: Nná yɛ, yeɛ yɛlɔle Nyameɛ ɔ, mmom, ye yeɛ oli moa lɔle yɛ, na ɔsomane ɔwa ne kyɛ ɔfa ye ngoa bɔ afɔleɛ pata<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “yɛ mbata afɔleɛ”</char></note> yɛ bɔne.<verse eid="1JN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Aliemaa mɔ, sɛ Nyameɛ alɔ yɛ de a, odikyɛ yɛ koso yɛdodɔ yɛ nwo. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Ebiala nnwuni Nyameɛ lle, nakoso sɛ yɛdodɔ yɛ nwo a, Nyameɛ kɔtena yɛ nu, na ye dɔ koli mu wɔ yɛ nu. <verse eid="1JN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ yɛne ye te kõ, na ye koso ɔne yɛ te kõ yeɛ ole kyɛ, wafa ye honhom ne wama yɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Afei, yɛ bɔbɔ yanwu ye, na yɛdi ye nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ, Baba ne somane ɔwa ne kyɛ wiase ne Agyenkwa. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ to nu kyɛ Yesu te Nyameɛ awa ne, Nyameɛ ne ye te kõ, na ɔne Nyameɛ te kõ. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Yanwu ɔdɔ bɔ Nyameɛ le ma yɛ ne, na yedɛ yɛdi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1JN 4:16">Nyameɛ te ɔdɔ, na ebiala bɔ ɔte ɔdɔ nu ne, ɔne Nyameɛ te kõ, na Nyameɛ koso ne ye te kõ. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Sɔ atee he aso yeɛ ɔdɔ di mu wɔ yɛ nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yekonya ahotɔsoɛ atemmuda ne, ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ Yesu te ne, sɔ ala yeɛ yɛte wɔ wiase he anu ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Esuronyi biala nne ɔdɔ nu, ofikyɛ ɔdɔ bɔ odi mu ne, otu esuronyi bo. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, esuronyi twe yɛ sa. Na ebiala bɔ esuronyi aha ye ne, ye dɔ nni mu. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Yɛle ɔdɔ, ofikyɛ ye yeɛ oli moa lɔle yɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Ebiala bɔ ɔka kyɛ, “Medɔ Nyameɛ,” nakoso ɔtane oliema ne, né ɔlaka. Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔnnɔ oliema bɔ onwu ye ne, ɔngɔhora ngɔlɔ Nyameɛ bɔ onnwu ye ne. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Ahyɛdeɛ he yeɛ wafa wama yɛ ɔ: Ebiala bɔ ɔdɔ Nyameɛ ne, odikyɛ ɔdɔ oliema koso.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ di kyɛ Yesu te Kristo ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ wawo ye ɔ, na ebiala bɔ ɔdɔ Nyameɛ ne, ɔdɔ bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ awo bɛ ne. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Sɛ yɛdɔ Nyameɛ na yɛdi ye ahyɛdeɛ so a, ɛhene yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ yɛdɔ Nyameɛ mmaa mɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Bɔ yɛyɛ a okyire kyɛ yɛdɔ Nyameɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛkoli ye ahyɛdeɛ so; na ye ahyɛdeɛ ne nnyɛ se, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ Nyameɛ awo ye ne, wali wiase naso ngunim. Na yɛ gyidie yeɛ yɛfa yɛdi wiase naso ngunim ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora koli wiase naso ngunim ɔ? Sana sona bɔ odɛ di kyɛ Yesu te Nyameɛ awa ne.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Bɔ ɔnate nzue ne mogya so wale ne yeɛ ole Yesu Kristo. Nná nzue ngome yeɛ ɔnate so wale ɔ, mmom nzue ne mogya. Na honhom ne di ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ, ofikyɛ honhom ne yeɛ ole nahorɛ ne. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Nningyein nza yeɛ odi ɛhe anwo adanzeɛ ɔ: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Honhom, nzue, yeɛ mogya; na bɛ mmɛsa né adanzeɛ ne yia.<verse eid="1JN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Na sɛ yedɛ sona adanzeɛ yɛto nu a, ye de, yedɛ Nyameɛ adanzeɛ ne yɛto nu paa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Maa ɔbo so.”</char></note> Ná adanzeɛ he yeɛ Nyameɛ ali afa ɔwa nanwo ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ Nyameɛ awa ne di ne, ole sɔ adanzeɛ ne wɔ ye nu. Na ebiala bɔ onne Nyameɛ nni ne, wamaa Nyameɛ ayɛ ngondomboniɛ, ofikyɛ adanzeɛ bɔ Nyameɛ ali afa ɔwa nanwo ne, onne nni. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Adanzeɛ ne ɛhe: Nyameɛ ama yɛ daa ngoa, na sɔ ngoa ne wɔ Ɔwa ne nu. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Ebiala bɔ odɛ́ baa ne di ne, ole sɔ ngoa ne, na ebiala bɔ onne Nyameɛ awa ne nni ne, olle sɔ ngoa ne.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Metworɔ ɛhe mebrɛ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔle gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ awa ne dumaa nanu ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konwu kyɛ ɛmɔle daa ngoa. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Ahotɔsoɛ bɔ yɛle ye wɔ Nyameɛ nu yeɛ ole kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ yɛkobisa ye, bɔ ɔne yɛ pɛ yia ne, okotie yɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Na ɔnate kyɛ yɛse kyɛ otie bɔ yɛbisa biala nati, ye de bɔ yabisa ne, yɛ sa kɔha ye, ofikyɛ yabisa yafi ye berɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Sɛ ebie nwu kyɛ oliema bie yɛ bɔne bɔ ɔmva ye ngɔ ewue nu a, ma ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ma ye, na Nyameɛ kɔma ye ngoa, ɔkɔma bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ bɔne ne ngoa. Nakoso bɔne bie wɔ berɛ a, ɔfa sona kɔ ewue nu; sɔ bɔne ne de, menga kyɛ ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ma ye. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Nikye bɔ ɔndengyɛ biala te bɔne, nakoso bɔne ne bie wɔ berɛ a, ɔmva sona ngɔ ewue nu.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Yɛse kyɛ, ebiala bɔ Nyameɛ awo ye ne, ɔndena bɔne nu, na Nyameɛ Awa ne bɔ ye nwo waen, yeti ɔbɔnefoɛ ne nnya ye. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔbɔle yɛ ɔ, nakoso ewiase namukoraati wura ɔbɔnefoɛ ne sa. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ Awa né awa, na wabukye y'adwene nu maa yanwu bɔ odi nahorɛ ne. Na yɛnate ɔwa Yesu Kristo so ne bɔ odi nahorɛ né ayɛ kõ. Ye yeɛ ole Nahorɛ Nyameɛ ne daa ngoa ne.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi <char style="tl">statu</char> bɔ ɛmɔsõ bɛ nanwo.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>